WEBVTT

00:00:59.180 --> 00:01:02.308
but a while ago she started having
cognitive challenges too.

00:01:02.934 --> 00:01:04.727
She couldn’t write stories anymore,

00:01:04.727 --> 00:01:07.105
and communication between us
kept getting harder.

00:01:07.230 --> 00:01:08.689
My mom’s doctor didn’t get it.

00:01:09.065 --> 00:01:11.776
He asked her questions
like, “Well, what city are you in?”

00:01:11.776 --> 00:01:12.819
She knows the answer.

00:01:13.277 --> 00:01:14.737
He asked, “What year is it?”

00:01:14.946 --> 00:01:16.531
Well, she knew that answer too.

00:01:16.989 --> 00:01:18.574
He just said, “You’re fine!”

00:01:20.201 --> 00:01:22.203
But my mom had been having hallucinations.

00:01:22.578 --> 00:01:25.373
She sometimes thought
she was surrounded by ghostly people.

00:01:26.207 --> 00:01:27.959
The doctor couldn’t see it,

00:01:27.959 --> 00:01:29.627
but my mom could ...

00:01:29.627 --> 00:01:31.337
and now so can you.